# TSCG Instances - Complete Grammar SHACL Schema v1.6
# 2026-11-15 (v1.9): the scoring family is retired (score shapes removed).
# Author: Echopraxium with the collaboration of Claude AI
# Date: 2026-06-28
# Status: ACTIVE
#
# ============================================
# CHANGELOG
# ============================================
# v1.9 (2026-11-15): SCORING FAMILY RETIRED (epistemological reason: a model is not
#   legitimate to evaluate itself — CH4 LayerCake_Models_The_Kit.md §6).
#   - REMOVED: the 20 property shapes m0:scoreA … m0:focalClass of m0:TscgInstanceShape,
#     m0:FocalScoreCoherenceShape, m0:ForbidStringSpectralClassShape,
#     m0:ForbidStringScoringStatusShape, m0:ForbidStringFocalClassShape.
#   - Messages of ForbidAsfidScores / ForbidRevoiScores / ForbidOrive no longer advise scores.
#   - Uses of deprecated terms are caught by check_m0 C16 (set read from M0_Common).
# v1.8 (2026-09-30): WS-1 lot 1e — changelog container m2:changelog -> m3:changelog (recommended);
#   m2:changelog FORBIDDEN (sh:maxCount 0). Entries {owl:versionInfo, dcterms:date, adms:versionNotes}.
# v1.7 (2026-09-01): SC-3 — FACET MECHANISM MOVED TO M3
#   - REMOVED: m0:DemocratizationFacetContractShape, m0:RoleGroundingShape,
#     m0:ForbidStringRoleGroundingShape (their M0 apparatus is gone from M0_Common v1.3.0).
#   - RENAMED + REPOINTED: m0:ForbidStringHasFacetShape -> m0:ForbidStringHasFacetValueShape,
#     now guarding m3:hasFacetValue (was m0:hasFacet).
#   - Facet mechanism now lives in M3_GenesisGrammar v4.6.0.
# v1.6 (2026-06-28): DEMOCRATIZATION FACET CONTRACT
#   - NEW: m0:DemocratizationFacetContractShape — SPARQL constraint enforcing
#     m0:illustratesConcept (minCount 1) when m0:hasFacet = m0:facet.Democratization
#   - NEW: m0:ForbidStringHasFacetShape — m0:hasFacet must be IRI, never string
#   - NEW: m0:RoleGroundingShape — validates m0:roleGrounding enum (Reused|Designed)
#   - NEW: m0:ForbidStringRoleGroundingShape — m0:roleGrounding must be IRI
#   - Infrastructure: m0:Facet class + m0:hasFacet + m0:facet.Democratization
#     + m0:illustratesConcept + m0:RoleGrounding defined in M0_Common.jsonld v1.2.0
#   - Facets are orthogonal to m3:ontologyType — applicable to all instance types
#
# v1.5 (2026-06-19): M0_Common.jsonld + ENUMERATION TYPES
#   - BREAKING: m0: prefix updated from M0_Poclet# → M0_Common.jsonld# (canonical source of truth)
#   - BREAKING: m0:spectralClass now owl:ObjectProperty — value MUST be sh:nodeKind sh:IRI
#     Valid IRIs: m0:spectralClass.Coherent | .OnCriticalLine | .Liminal | .Enigmatic
#   - BREAKING: m0:focalClass now owl:ObjectProperty — value MUST be sh:nodeKind sh:IRI
#     Valid IRIs: m0:focalClass.Emmetropic | .SlightlyMyopic | .SlightlyHyperopic | .Myopic | .Hyperopic | .Astigmatic
#   - BREAKING: m0:scoringStatus now owl:ObjectProperty — value MUST be sh:nodeKind sh:IRI
#     Valid IRIs: m0:scoringStatus.Complete | .Partial | .Pending
#   - BREAKING: Score values are now bare numerics (no @type:xsd:float annotation needed)
#     rdfs:range xsd:float declared in M0_Common.jsonld — parsers infer type
#   - NEW: owl:imports M0_Common.jsonld REQUIRED in all M0 instances
#   - UPDATED: Naming convention documented — camelCase.PascalCase for enum values
#   - FORBIDDEN: A_score/S_score/... aliases (replaced by m0:scoreA/m0:scoreS/...)
#   - FORBIDDEN: {"@value":"0.85","@type":"xsd:float"} — use bare 0.85
#
# v1.4 (2026-06-19): NAMESPACE IRI CONVENTION — m0.<instance>: and m1.extension.<domain>: enforcement
#   - NEW: m0:CanonicalNamespaceShape — VIOLATION if any property IRI is not an absolute URL
#   - NEW: m0:CanonicalTscgBaseShape  — WARNING if TSCG IRI uses non-canonical repo base
#   - DOCUMENTED: 23/32 instances have namespace violations (unresolved @context aliases)
#   - Root causes catalogued: m0: declared relative, m1core: undeclared, @base missing
#   - Convention: m0.<instance>: and m1.extension.<domain>: aliases MUST resolve to HTTPS
#
# v1.3 (2026-06-19): SCORE CONVENTION ENFORCEMENT + FOCAL SCORE (Gs stereopsis)
#   - BREAKING: m0:asfidScores{} and m0:revoiScores{} sub-objects → FORBIDDEN
#   - BREAKING: eagle_eye:*/sphinx_eye:* as score properties → FORBIDDEN
#   - NEW: Flat scores A_score..Im_score at owl:Ontology root level → STRONGLY RECOMMENDED
#   - NEW: m0:asfidMean, m0:revoiMean → RECOMMENDED
#   - NEW: m0:epistemicGap constraint tightened (coherence check documented)
#   - NEW: m0:spectralClass enum constraint added
#   - NEW: m0:scoringStatus → OPTIONAL ("complete"|"partial"|"pending")
#   - NEW: Focal Score family (Gs stereopsis) → OPTIONAL, conditional on focalApplicable
#     - m0:focalApplicable (boolean, always)
#     - m0:stereopsicDepth [0,1]
#     - m0:focalBias [-1,1]  — signed: REVOI_mean - ASFID_mean
#     - m0:focalScore [0,1]  — SFE = stereopsicDepth × (1 - |focalBias|)
#     - m0:focalClass enum (Emmetropic|SlightlyMyopic|SlightlyHyperopic|Myopic|Hyperopic|Astigmatic)
#     - m0:stereopsicDepthProfile (object)
#   - Updated corpus stats: 33 instances (26 poclets + 2 SF + 1 SSG + 3 TscgTools + 1 stub)
#   - m3:ontologyType values extended: TscgTool added
#
# v1.2 (2026-04-19): Absolute URL requirements for pyshacl
# v1.1 (2026-04-18): Domain property migration to M1 level (m0:domain → m1:domain)
# v1.0 (2026-04-13): FINAL grammar after complete corpus analysis (26 instances)
# ============================================

@prefix sh:      <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix m0:      <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M0_Common.jsonld#> .
@prefix m1:      <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#> .
@prefix m2:      <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M2_GenericConcepts.jsonld#> .
@prefix m3:      <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M3_GenesisGrammar.jsonld#> .

# ============================================
# NAMESPACE POLICY (CRITICAL)
# ============================================
# ALLOWED NAMESPACES:
#   Standard:  owl, rdf, rdfs, skos, dcterms, xsd
#   TSCG:      m3, m2, m1 (+ extensions m1:extension:<domain>:), m0
#
# FORBIDDEN NAMESPACES:
#   tscg:        → use m0: for instance-specific properties
#   eagle_eye:*  → MonoidalTypes, NOT score properties (v1.3)
#   sphinx_eye:* → MonoidalTypes, NOT score properties (v1.3)
#
# @CONTEXT URL REQUIREMENTS (pyshacl — CRITICAL):
#   ALL namespace URLs MUST be ABSOLUTE:
#   ✅ "m3": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M3_GenesisGrammar.jsonld#"
#   ❌ "m3": "M3_GenesisGrammar.jsonld#"
#
# SCORES, MEANS, GAP, SPECTRAL / FOCAL CLASSES, SCORING STATUS: RETIRED (v1.9, 2026-11-15).
#   No M0 instance carries a score or a gap: a model is not legitimate to evaluate
#   itself (CH4 LayerCake_Models_The_Kit.md §6). The terms stay in M0_Common as
#   owl:deprecated; check_m0 C16 forbids any use. The v1.5 score and enumeration
#   conventions that stood here are kept in the changelog above.
#
# M0_Common.jsonld (v1.5 NEW — MANDATORY):
#   All M0 instances MUST declare in @context:
#     "m0": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M0_Common.jsonld#"
#   AND in owl:imports: "M0_Common.jsonld"
#   Instance-local properties use: "m0.<instanceName>": "instances/.../M0_<Name>.jsonld#"
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# TSCG INSTANCE TYPES (v1.3 — 4 validated types)
# ============================================
# m3:Poclet              — primary M0 instance type (26 instances)
# m3:SystemicFramework   — external methodology (Vsm, Triz, Bmc)
# m3:SymbolicSystemGrammar — formal symbolic grammar (IChing)
# m3:TscgTool            — reflexive TSCG tooling instances
# ============================================

# ============================================
# COMMON TSCG INSTANCE SHAPE
# ============================================
m0:TscgInstanceShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:name "TSCG Instance Common Shape v1.3" ;
  sh:description "Common constraints for all TSCG instances. Score Convention Option B enforced. Focal Score (Gs) added as optional conditional block." ;

  # ===== MANDATORY PROPERTIES =====

  sh:property [
    sh:path rdf:type ;
    sh:hasValue owl:Ontology ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:message "CRITICAL: All TSCG instances MUST have @type: owl:Ontology (never owl:NamedIndividual)."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path m3:ontologyType ;
    sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;
    sh:in ( m3:Poclet m3:SystemicFramework m3:SymbolicSystemGrammar m3:TscgTool ) ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "CRITICAL: m3:ontologyType MUST be one of: m3:Poclet, m3:SystemicFramework, m3:SymbolicSystemGrammar, m3:TscgTool. NEVER use m3:ontologyCategory or m2:ontologyCategory."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path rdfs:label ;
    sh:datatype xsd:string ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "rdfs:label is MANDATORY. Use rdfs:label, NOT dcterms:title."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path rdfs:comment ;
    sh:datatype xsd:string ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:message "rdfs:comment is MANDATORY. Use rdfs:comment, NOT dcterms:description."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path owl:versionInfo ;
    sh:datatype xsd:string ;
    sh:pattern "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+$" ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "owl:versionInfo MUST follow semantic versioning X.Y.Z. Use owl:versionInfo, NOT m0:version."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path dcterms:creator ;
    sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;
    sh:hasValue <https://github.com/Echopraxium> ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "dcterms:creator MUST be the IRI <https://github.com/Echopraxium> (lot D1, Michel 2026-11-16: DCMI recommends a URI for the creator)."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path dcterms:contributor ;
    sh:datatype xsd:string ;
    sh:hasValue "Claude AI (Anthropic)" ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "dcterms:contributor MUST be exactly 'Claude AI (Anthropic)' (the collaboration, recorded apart from the creator; lot D1, 2026-11-16)."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path dcterms:created ;
    sh:or (
      [ sh:datatype xsd:date ]
      [ sh:datatype xsd:string ]
    ) ;
    sh:pattern "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$" ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:message "dcterms:created MUST be present in format YYYY-MM-DD."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path m1:domain ;
    sh:or (
      [ sh:datatype xsd:string ]
      [ sh:nodeKind sh:Literal ]
    ) ;
    sh:minCount 1 ;
    sh:message "m1:domain is MANDATORY (use m1:domain, NOT m0:domain). Accepts single string or array. Values registered in M1_Domains.jsonld."
  ] ;

  # ===== STRONGLY RECOMMENDED =====

  sh:property [
    sh:path owl:imports ;
    sh:minCount 0 ;
    sh:message "owl:imports is strongly recommended — should list M3, M2, M1 ontologies."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path m3:changelog ;
    sh:minCount 0 ;
    sh:message "m3:changelog is strongly recommended. MUST be an array of {owl:versionInfo, dcterms:date, adms:versionNotes} objects. Max 3 entries (rolling), newest first. NOT a bare string array."
  ] ;

  sh:property [
    sh:path m2:changelog ;
    sh:maxCount 0 ;
    sh:message "FORBIDDEN: m2:changelog is retired (WS-1 lot 1e, 2026-09-30) — use m3:changelog."
  ] .

# ===== SCORES — RETIRED (v1.9, 2026-11-15) =====
# The 20 property shapes on m0:scoreA … m0:focalClass are removed: the scoring
# family is deprecated in M0_Common (a model is not legitimate to evaluate
# itself — docs/CoreHypotheses/LayerCake_Models_The_Kit.md §6). Any use of a
# deprecated term is now caught by check_m0 C16, which reads the deprecated set
# from M0_Common.

# ============================================
# FORBIDDEN PATTERNS (v1.3 — extended)
# ============================================

# FORBIDDEN: owl:NamedIndividual at ontology level
m0:ForbidNamedIndividualShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path rdf:type ;
      sh:hasValue owl:NamedIndividual
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: TSCG instances MUST use @type: owl:Ontology, NOT owl:NamedIndividual." .

# FORBIDDEN: m0:asfidScores{} sub-object (Pattern A — obsolete since v1.3)
m0:ForbidAsfidScoresSubObjectShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path m0:asfidScores ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: m0:asfidScores{} is obsolete. Scores are retired (2026-11-15): a model is not legitimate to evaluate itself; evaluation is done by the observers of the mock-up, outside the model (CH4 LayerCake_Models_The_Kit.md §6)." .

# FORBIDDEN: m0:revoiScores{} sub-object (Pattern A — obsolete since v1.3)
m0:ForbidRevoiScoresSubObjectShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path m0:revoiScores ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: m0:revoiScores{} is obsolete. Scores are retired (2026-11-15): a model is not legitimate to evaluate itself; evaluation is done by the observers of the mock-up, outside the model (CH4 LayerCake_Models_The_Kit.md §6)." .

# FORBIDDEN: m3:ontologyCategory and m2:ontologyCategory
m0:ForbidObsoleteOntologyCategoriesShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:or (
      [ sh:property [ sh:path m3:ontologyCategory ; sh:minCount 1 ] ]
      [ sh:property [ sh:path m2:ontologyCategory ; sh:minCount 1 ] ]
    )
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: m3:ontologyCategory and m2:ontologyCategory are obsolete. Use m3:ontologyType exclusively." .

# FORBIDDEN: dcterms:title at ontology level
m0:ForbidDctermsTitleShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path dcterms:title ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: Use rdfs:label instead of dcterms:title at ontology level." .

# FORBIDDEN: dcterms:description at ontology level
m0:ForbidDctermsDescriptionShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path dcterms:description ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: Use rdfs:comment instead of dcterms:description at ontology level." .

# FORBIDDEN: m0:version (use owl:versionInfo)
m0:ForbidM0VersionShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path m0:version ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: Use owl:versionInfo instead of m0:version." .

# FORBIDDEN: m2:ontologyType (wrong namespace)
m0:ForbidM2OntologyTypeShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path m2:ontologyType ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: Only m3:ontologyType is valid. Do NOT use m2:ontologyType (wrong namespace)." .

# FORBIDDEN: obsolete ORIVE terminology
m0:ForbidOriveShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:or (
      [ sh:property [ sh:path m0:oriveScores ; sh:minCount 1 ] ]
      [ sh:property [ sh:path m0:sphinxEye_ORIVE ; sh:minCount 1 ] ]
    )
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN: ORIVE is obsolete terminology. Use REVOI throughout. R = Representability (NEVER Reproducibility). (Scores, including REVOI scores, are retired since 2026-11-15.)" .

# FORBIDDEN: tscg: namespace
m0:ForbidTscgNamespaceShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:sparql [
    a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;
    sh:message "FORBIDDEN NAMESPACE: 'tscg:' namespace is not allowed. Use standard (owl/rdf/rdfs/skos/dcterms/xsd) or TSCG (m3/m2/m1/m0) namespaces." ;
    sh:select """
      SELECT $this ?property ?value
      WHERE {
        $this ?property ?value .
        FILTER(STRSTARTS(STR(?property), "http://undefined.tscg.namespace/") ||
               REGEX(STR(?property), "tscg:", "i"))
      }
      LIMIT 1
    """
  ] .

# FOCAL SCORE COHERENCE RULES (v1.3): REMOVED in v1.9 (focal family deprecated).

# ============================================
# FACET STRING GUARD (v1.7 — SC-3)
# ============================================
# SC-3 (WS-0 Structural Cleanup) moved the Facet mechanism to M3
# (m3:Facet / m3:FacetValue / m3:valueOf / m3:hasFacetValue in M3_GenesisGrammar v4.6.0).
# The former m0:facet.* apparatus is removed from M0_Common.jsonld (v1.3.0):
# m0:Facet, m0:hasFacet, m0:facet.Democratization, m0:illustratesConcept,
# m0:RoleGrounding, m0:roleGrounding(.Reused/.Designed) — all gone.
# Consequently these v1.6 shapes are REMOVED: m0:DemocratizationFacetContractShape,
# m0:RoleGroundingShape, m0:ForbidStringRoleGroundingShape.
# The single surviving guard is renamed and repointed onto the new M3 property.
# Audience is optional (SC-3 Decision #2) — no presence shape.

# FORBIDDEN: string value for m3:hasFacetValue
m0:ForbidStringHasFacetValueShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:not [
    sh:property [
      sh:path m3:hasFacetValue ;
      sh:datatype xsd:string ;
      sh:minCount 1
    ]
  ] ;
  sh:message "FORBIDDEN (v1.7 — SC-3): m3:hasFacetValue must be an IRI of a registered m3:FacetValue (e.g. {'@id': 'm3:audience.KitUser'}), NOT a string literal. Use @id notation." .


# ============================================
# M0_Common.jsonld IMPORT CONSTRAINT (v1.5)
# ============================================
m0:RequireM0CommonImportShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:severity sh:Warning ;
  sh:sparql [
    a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;
    sh:message "M0_Common.jsonld IMPORT RECOMMENDED (v1.5): All M0 instances should declare owl:imports M0_Common.jsonld to inherit the shared m0: vocabulary (the federating namespace). Without this import, m0: properties may not resolve correctly in OWL reasoners." ;
    sh:select """
      PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
      PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
      SELECT $this
      WHERE {
        $this rdf:type owl:Ontology .
        FILTER NOT EXISTS {
          $this owl:imports ?imp .
          FILTER(
            CONTAINS(STR(?imp), "M0_Common") ||
            CONTAINS(STR(?imp), "m0_common")
          )
        }
      }
    """
  ] .

# FORBIDDEN string values for m0:spectralClass / m0:scoringStatus / m0:focalClass (v1.5):
# REMOVED in v1.9 — the three enumerations are deprecated; C16 forbids any use.

# ============================================
# FORBIDDEN: A_score/S_score/... aliases (v1.5)
# ============================================
# These were @context aliases resolving to M0_Poclet# (now replaced by m0:scoreX → M0_Common.jsonld#).
# If still present as unresolved aliases, they appear as non-canonical IRIs
# and are already caught by m0:CanonicalNamespaceShape.
# Documented here for clarity.
#
# FORBIDDEN aliases (must NOT appear in @context):
#   "A_score", "S_score", "F_score", "It_score", "D_score"
#   "R_score", "E_score", "V_score", "O_score", "Im_score"
# (v1.9, 2026-11-15) m0:scoreA … m0:scoreIm are deprecated too: there is no
# correct form of a score any more.

# ============================================
# STATISTICS (v1.5 — 2026-06-19)
# ============================================
# Corpus: 33 instances
#   26 Poclets + 3 SystemicFrameworks (Vsm, Triz, Bmc)
#   + 1 SymbolicSystemGrammar (IChing) + 3 TscgTools
#
# Score / focal / spectral / scoring-status notes: REMOVED in v1.9 (2026-11-15).
# The whole scoring family is deprecated in M0_Common; see the v1.9 changelog.
# ============================================

# ============================================
# NAMESPACE IRI CONVENTION (v1.4 — 2026-06-19)
# ============================================
#
# RULE: Every property IRI used in a TSCG M0 instance MUST begin with
# one of the canonical HTTPS prefixes. An IRI that does NOT start with
# "https://" signals a broken/unresolved @context alias or a relative
# URL — both are forbidden.
#
# ALLOWED IRI prefixes (exhaustive):
#   Standard W3C / Dublin Core:
#     http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#   (rdf:)
#     http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#                 (owl:)
#     http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#          (rdfs:)
#     http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#           (skos:)
#     http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#                    (sh:)
#     http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#              (xsd:)
#     http://purl.org/dc/terms/                      (dcterms:)
#   TSCG canonical base (all m0/m1/m2/m3 namespaces resolve here):
#     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/
#   TSCG instances (m0.<instance>: namespace):
#     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/instances/
#
# FORBIDDEN patterns (what this constraint detects):
#   ❌ "m1core:simulationTitle"     → @context alias unresolved
#   ❌ "M0_Poclet#epistemicGap"     → relative URL (missing base)
#   ❌ "M0_Vco.jsonld#A"            → relative filename (missing base)
#   ❌ "m0bmc:Block_VP"             → short alias (deprecated, use m0.bmc:)
#   ❌ "m1.ext:chemistry:Foo"       → dot-separated but non-canonical
#   ❌ Anything not starting with http:// or https://
#
# NOTE on dot separator convention for local namespaces:
#   Instance-local properties MUST use the pattern:
#     m0.<instanceName>:   →  resolves to instances/.../M0_<Name>.jsonld#
#   M1 extension properties MUST use:
#     m1.extension.<domain>:  →  resolves to ontology/M1_extensions/.../M1_<D>.jsonld#
#   These are @context ALIASES — the IRI they resolve to must be canonical HTTPS.
#   The alias name convention (dot separator) is enforced by documentation
#   and linting; SHACL enforces that the RESOLVED IRI is always canonical HTTPS.
# ============================================

m0:CanonicalNamespaceShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:severity sh:Violation ;
  sh:sparql [
    a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;
    sh:message "NAMESPACE VIOLATION (v1.4): Property IRI is not an absolute URL. This means an @context alias is unresolved (e.g. 'm1core:', 'm0bmc:') or a relative URL was used (e.g. 'M0_Poclet#foo', 'M0_Vco.jsonld#A'). Root causes: (1) m0: declared as relative 'M0_Poclet#' instead of absolute URL in @context; (2) alias not declared in @context at all; (3) @base missing or incorrect. Fix: declare ALL aliases with absolute HTTPS URLs in @context. Canonical prefixes: m0='.../M0_Common.jsonld#', m1='.../M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#', m1core='.../M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#', m2='.../M2_GenericConcepts.jsonld#', m3='.../M3_GenesisGrammar.jsonld#'." ;
    sh:select """
      PREFIX rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
      PREFIX owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>

      SELECT DISTINCT $this ?unresolved_property
      WHERE {
        $this rdf:type owl:Ontology .
        $this ?unresolved_property ?value .

        FILTER (
          # Reject any IRI that is not an absolute URL (no http:// or https://)
          !STRSTARTS(STR(?unresolved_property), "http://") &&
          !STRSTARTS(STR(?unresolved_property), "https://")
        )
      }
      LIMIT 5
    """
  ] .

# ── ADDITIONAL: detect m0: resolved to non-canonical base ──────────────
# When @context declares m0 with relative URL "M0_Poclet#" instead of
# the canonical absolute URL, rdflib emits the alias name literally.
# The constraint above catches this as a non-http IRI.
# BUT: some rdflib versions DO partially resolve relative @context URLs,
# producing IRIs like "M0_Poclet#epistemicGap" (still not absolute).
# The filter !STRSTARTS(..., "http") catches both cases.
#
# CANONICAL m0: MUST resolve to:
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/M0_Poclet#
# NOT: "M0_Poclet#" (relative) nor bare "m0:" (unresolved prefix)
#
# CANONICAL m0.<instance>: pattern (ALLOWED — these ARE absolute HTTPS IRIs):
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/instances/...
#   resolved from @context alias: "m0.bmc": "instances/systemic-frameworks/Bmc/M0_Bmc.jsonld#"
#   with @base: "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/"
#   NOTE: The @base must be set so that relative instance paths resolve correctly.

# ============================================
# ADDITIONALLY: Detect relative-style IRIs that start with http://
# but reference non-canonical TSCG namespaces (e.g. obsolete repos)
# ============================================

m0:CanonicalTscgBaseShape
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass owl:Ontology ;
  sh:severity sh:Warning ;
  sh:sparql [
    a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;
    sh:message "NAMESPACE WARNING (v1.4): TSCG property IRI references a non-canonical repository base. All TSCG-specific IRIs MUST use 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/' as base. Detected IRI uses an alternate path (old repo, local path, or incorrect branch). Fix: update @context to use canonical base URL." ;
    sh:select """
      PREFIX rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
      PREFIX owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>

      SELECT DISTINCT $this ?non_canonical_property
      WHERE {
        $this rdf:type owl:Ontology .
        $this ?non_canonical_property ?value .

        # Detect TSCG-looking IRIs that don't use the canonical base
        FILTER (
          STRSTARTS(STR(?non_canonical_property), "https://") &&

          # Contains "echopraxium" or "tscg" but NOT the canonical path
          (
            CONTAINS(LCASE(STR(?non_canonical_property)), "echopraxium") ||
            CONTAINS(LCASE(STR(?non_canonical_property)), "tscg")
          ) &&

          # NOT the canonical base
          !STRSTARTS(
            STR(?non_canonical_property),
            "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/"
          )
        )
      }
      LIMIT 5
    """
  ] .

# ============================================
# SUMMARY OF NAMESPACE VIOLATIONS DETECTED IN CORPUS (v1.4 audit)
# ============================================
# Files with unresolved @context aliases (m1core:, m0:, relative URLs):
#   FireTriangle       : m1core:simulationTitle, M0_Poclet#epistemicGap
#   ColorSynthesis     : m1core:simulationTitle + m0: unresolved props
#   Counterpoint       : M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#simulationTitle (relative)
#   FourStrokeEngine   : M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#simulationTitle (relative)
#   ExposureTriangle   : m1core:simulationTitle + m0: unresolved props
#   KindlebergerMinsky : M0_KindlebergerMinsky.jsonld#xxx (relative)
#   MtgColorWheel      : m1core:simulationTitle
#   NakamotoConsensus  : M0_Poclets.jsonld#xxx (wrong filename, relative)
#   Ptoe               : m1core:simulationTitle
#   Transistor         : m1core:simulationTitle
#   TrophicPyramid     : M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#xxx (relative)
#   Vco                : M0_Vco.jsonld#A/S/F... (relative scores!)
#
# Root causes:
#   1. m1core: → not declared in @context with absolute URL
#      Fix: add "m1core": "https://.../M1_CoreConcepts.jsonld#" to @context
#      OR use m1:simulationTitle (m1: already declared with absolute URL)
#
#   2. M0_Xxx.jsonld#prop → @base not set, or @base set incorrectly
#      Fix: ensure "@base": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Echopraxium/tscg/main/ontology/"
#      Then instance-local prefix becomes: "m0.<instance>": "instances/.../M0_X.jsonld#"
#
#   3. M0_Poclets.jsonld (NakamotoConsensus) → wrong source file referenced
#      Fix: update @context to reference M0_NakamotoConsensus.jsonld#
# ============================================
